  "purpose": "Locally served Yan Console Markdown parsing/sanitization and a consistent technical reading font stack. No CDN requests at runtime.",
  "sources_policy": "JavaScript is copied unchanged from the version-pinned npm release after archive SHA-512 verification. Fonts and their licenses are copied unchanged from the upstream GitHub repositories at fixed commits after Git blob SHA-1 verification. All bundled files also have local SHA-256 checksums.",
  "selection_notes": [
    "markdown-it 15.0.3 is the actual current stable npm release verified at the registry; search results advertising 15.0.2 are stale.",
    "DOMPurify 3.4.17 is verified both in npm package.json and the distributed JavaScript version banner.",
    "Source Han Sans CN is the official Simplified Chinese regional subset, not a UI-character subset. Its complete upstream variable WOFF2 is bundled as one file; no font rewriting, subsetting, renaming inside the font, CDN dependency, or font build step was introduced.",
    "Inter handles Western UI/body text; Source Han Sans CN handles Chinese. JetBrains Mono is reserved for code and identifiers. A system sans-serif fallback remains useful while local font assets load or for characters beyond bundled font coverage."
  ],
